menu "OT BR Matter support"

    config OT_BR_MATTER_SRP_AUTO_ENABLE
        bool "Enable SRP server auto-enable mode"
        default y
        help
            Matter-over-Thread devices register their DNS-SD services
            (_matter._tcp, _matterc._udp) with the SRP server of the border router.
            In auto-enable mode the SRP server runs whenever border routing runs.

    config OT_BR_MATTER_NAT64
        bool "Enable NAT64 prefix manager"
        default y
        help
            Publishes a NAT64 prefix into the Thread network, so that Thread
            devices can reach IPv4-only hosts (e.g. for OTA or cloud services).

endmenu
